{"4455560": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Desecrated", "steam_appid": 4455560, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >10 years after abandoning your role as cult leader, the people you abandoned has finally found you.  Sending various demons after you to get back the powers you took.  Tired of hiding, take the fight to them and end them all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fast paced FPS inspired by old Fps games</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use a variety of weapons and your demon powers to dismember your enemies as your fight through various locations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Collect up to 7 different weapons to  demolish your enemies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your demon power to grab various weapons around the levels to dismember your enemies such as spears, sawblades, and explosive barrels.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Grab various enemies with your demons powers to execute them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455560/extras/9af2813b27b7cc6728944daea8e3fc49.avif?t=1784372250\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455560/extras/f45d507267d2fb70d382306c62529734.avif?t=1784372250\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4455560/extras/c38d68a706aba9bdd1159d281e533699.avif?t=1784372250\" width=1560 height=878 /></span></p><